            "short_description": "The year is 2192 AD. Forty years ago, the Stellar-class All-purpose Administrative Computer ALLTYNEX suddenly turned on mankind, unleashing armies of unmanned weapons that wiped out about 85% of the world's population within just 72 hours.",
